Guidelime.registerGuide([[
[N 47-50 Un'Goro Crater]
[D Forever Shaman 30-60 (Braedyn)\\The Borrower to Gadgetzan (bind), then Un'Goro Crater from the Tanaris side: the raft and Linken's pack, Marshal's Refuge (flight point), J.D. Collie's crystals and pylons; then, as your level opens them, the Marshal's Refuge, Torwa Pathfinder and Spraggle Frock quests. The round ends here: what your level has not opened is where round 3 starts.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel 48|r  -  this chapter wants level 48; you arrive at about 47.4: Tier A is open; do it, then go on only as your level opens the next tier. Tier A (The Borrower, the raft and Linken's pack, J.D. Collie's crystals and pylons) needs 47; its mobs are 48-50 on the east side and up to 54 round the Western Pylon. Tier B needs 48, Tier C 49, Tier D 50, and each tier opens with a gate line. On the required quests' XP alone you end Tier A at about 47.8 and may not reach 48: the conditional quests (Microcrystal Contamination, Williden's Journal) and your kills on the east side's level 48-50 mobs decide it. Whatever your level has not opened when you stop is where round 3 starts: the Check at the end lists it
[OC]|cffffffffUn'Goro Crater|r  -  you start at Talrendis Point after chapter 55 with hearth = Talrendis Point and bind Gadgetzan (the DB has no innkeeper in Un'Goro). About 73,230 quest XP on the plain quests if you play all four tiers (A 25,080, B 23,500, C 10,550, D 14,100) and 2g 45s of quest money; every giver, hand-in, object and mob position comes from the DB, the roads do not. Every tier ends at Marshal's Refuge; chapter 57 flies out from there
[OC]|cffffcc00Carried in:|r The Borrower (2941, Daryn Lightwind, chapter 55) for Curgle Cranklehop in Gadgetzan. Riding through untouched: Return to Ironforge (2977) and Return to Tymor (3461) for chapter 57; Into The Temple of Atal'Hakkar (1475), Cortello's Riddle (624) and, if taken, Seed of Life (7066) for round 3
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Training:|r no shaman trainer in Tanaris or Un'Goro; the level 46 and 48 rows wait for Ironforge in chapter 57
[OC]|cFFFF0000Danger in the crater:|r elite Devilsaurs (54-56) at 34.6,22.4 / 57.3,23.7 / 31.2,36.4, Tyrant Devilsaurs at 74.2,33.0 / 50.1,60.7 and an Ironhide Devilsaur at 57.3,61.8 (the DB has single points; that they patrol is Classic knowledge, unverified); elite Stegodons (52-55) fill the south-west at 26-41,58-81; elite Stone Guardians (60-61) stand at 53.9,36.8 / 43.5,31.5 / 70.6,38.9 / 76.0,54.1 / 72.2,70.5 / 70.7,77.7 (whether they attack on sight is unverified). The DB also puts 21 level-60 "Venomhide Ravasaurs" (a Forever npc, 269206, reaction unknown) right round Torwa Pathfinder: if they are there and hostile, leave the quests that need Torwa (4290, 4291, 87492, 87494)

[OC]|cffffffffTier A - Gadgetzan|r  -  there is no direct flight from Talrendis Point to Gadgetzan: the game routes it through Theramore (unverified)
At [TAR12577 Jarrodenus], |cFFfff8a3Fly to [F Gadgetzan]|r (two hops, through Theramore; unverified) [G11.9,77.6 Azshara]
At [TAR7763 Curgle Cranklehop], [QT2941] (1,100 XP) [G52.4,26.9 Tanaris]
At [TAR7733 Innkeeper Fizzgrimble], bind your Hearthstone to [S Gadgetzan] (the Talrendis Point bind from chapter 55 ends here; chapter 57 starts from it) [G52.5,27.9 Tanaris]

[OC]|cffffffffInto the crater|r  -  ride west-south-west across Tanaris to the crater rim and down into south-east Un'Goro. The road is not in the data (unverified); Torwa Pathfinder's quest text puts him "near the entrance to Un'Goro Crater". Ghost Wolf for the ride
Ride into Un'Goro Crater to Torwa Pathfinder's camp: his quests need 48 and 50, so nothing to take yet. |cFFFF0000Danger:|r the level-60 Venomhide Ravasaurs the DB puts round him, Stone Guardians at 72.2,70.5 and 70.7,77.7 [G71.6,76.0 Un'Goro Crater]

[OC]|cffffffffThe raft|r  -  north-west to the pond. Ravasaurs 48-49 and Ravasaur Runners 49-50 round it (x57-68 y60-83); the Ravasaur Matriarch (rare, 50) stands 3 units north-west at 62.4,66.0
At A Wrecked Raft in the pond, [QA3844 It's a Secret to Everybody] (1,250 XP: look around the pond for a clue) [G63.0,68.6 Un'Goro Crater]
At A Small Pack beside it, [QT3844] (1,250 XP) [QA3845 It's a Secret to Everybody] (5,100 XP at the hand-in: bring the pack's contents to their owner) [G63.1,69.1 Un'Goro Crater]
Open the [UI11107 A Small Pack] for the Large Compass, the Curled Map Parchment and the Lion-headed Key [QC3845] [G63.1,69.1 Un'Goro Crater]

[OC]|cffffffffTo Marshal's Refuge|r  -  north up the east side (x62-72, mobs 48-51) to about y35, then north-west past the tar pits (Tar Beasts 50-51 to Tar Lords 53-54 at x41-65 y15-36); path unverified. |cFFFF0000Danger:|r Tyrant Devilsaur at 74.2,33.0, Devilsaur at 57.3,23.7, Stone Guardians at 70.6,38.9 and 53.9,36.8; the gorilla caves (50-53) east of the way at x60-69 y13-19
