At [TAR9117 J.D. Collie], [QA4284 Crystals of Power] (5,250 XP + 80s at the hand-in: 7 each of the Red, Yellow, Green and Blue Power Crystals) [G41.9,2.7 Un'Goro Crater]

[OC]|cffffffffPower Crystals|r  -  the east side again (x56-79 y20-79): 63 of the crater's 148 crystal points and its lowest mobs (Ravasaurs 48-51, Bloodpetal Lashers and Threshers 48-50, Muculent Ooze 48-50, Fledgling Pterrordax 48-50, Young Diemetradon 49-50). Which colour a cluster gives is not in the data. Loop south to about y75 and back north the same way. |cFFFF0000Danger:|r as on the way up, plus the Stone Guardian at 76.0,54.1, the Ironhide Devilsaur at 57.3,61.8 and the Tyrant Devilsaur at 50.1,60.7: keep east of x60 south of y55
Loot 7 Red, 7 Yellow, 7 Green and 7 Blue Power Crystals from the crystal clusters down the east side [QC4284] [G66.0,50.0 Un'Goro Crater]
[OC]Keep A Mangled Journal and a Crystal Infused Scale if either drops on this loop: they start Williden's Journal (Tier B) and Microcrystal Contamination

[OC]|cffffffffThe pylons|r  -  three ride-to stops, ordered for travel; the Western Pylon, the highest band, last
