At [TAR9117 J.D. Collie], [QT4285] [QT4287] [QT4288] (3,950 XP each) [QA4321 Making Sense of It] (530 XP: speak with him in a moment) [G41.9,2.7 Un'Goro Crater]
At [TAR9117 J.D. Collie], [QT4321] (530 XP; whether it completes at once or after his talk is unverified) [G41.9,2.7 Un'Goro Crater]
